r setup\",\"price\":1200,\"category\":\"extra\"},{\"label\":\"Styled cake & souvenir table\",\"price\":800,\"category\":\"extra\"},{\"label\":\"Celebrant name cut-out\",\"price\":700,\"category\":\"extra\"},{\"label\":\"Lighted age number\",\"price\":900,\"category\":\"extra\"},{\"label\":\"Fog machine effect\",\"price\":1800,\"category\":\"extra\"},{\"label\":\"Theme character appearance\",\"price\":1800,\"category\":\"extra\"},{\"label\":\"Buffet-style catering (per pax)\",\"price\":250,\"category\":\"catering\"},{\"label\":\"On-site catering coordination\",\"price\":2000,\"category\":\"catering\"}]',4,1,'2026-10-16 11:02:08','2026-10-16 11:02:08');
INSERT IGNORE INTO `faqs` (`id`, `question`, `answer`, `category`, `sort_order`, `is_active`) VALUES (1,'How does the quotation process work?','After you submit your customization request (theme, lights, sound, add-ons), our event manager reviews it and sends you a formal quotation. Your booking only proceeds once you approve that quotation.','Booking Process',1,1);
INSERT IGNORE INTO `faqs` (`id`, `question`, `answer`, `category`, `sort_order`, `is_active`) VALUES (2,'Can I customize the price of my package?','Yes. We no longer offer fixed packages. Every price is computed from your chosen venue/room, guest count, motif, and selected add-ons (lights, sound, extras), then confirmed in your quotation.','Pricing',2,1);
INSERT IGNORE INTO `faqs` (`id`, `question`, `answer`, `category`, `sort_order`, `is_active`) VALUES (3,'What payment methods are accepted?','We accept GCash, bank transfer, and cash. A downpayment is required to confirm your reservation; proof of payment is uploaded and validated by our staff.','Payments',3,1);
INSERT IGNORE INTO `faqs` (`id`, `question`, `answer`, `category`, `sort_order`, `is_active`) VALUES (4,'How do I know my payment was received?','Once you upload proof of payment, our staff validates it against your quoted amount. You will see the status update to \"Validated\" in your dashboard and receive an email confirmation.','Payments',4,1);
INSERT IGNORE INTO `faqs` (`id`, `question`, `answer`, `category`, `sort_order`, `is_active`) VALUES (5,'Can I change my theme or motif after booking?','Changes are possible before the quotation is approved. Once approved, changes may require a revised quotation.','Customization',5,1);
INSERT IGNORE INTO `faqs` (`id`, `question`, `answer`, `category`, `sort_order`, `is_active`) VALUES (6,'What happens if I decline the quotation?','You may request revisions or cancel the request entirely. No payment is required unless you approve a quotation.','Booking Process',6,1);
